#. module: competency_management
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:competency_management.field_competency_competency__name
msgid "Competency Name"
msgstr "የብቃት ስም"

#. module: competency_management
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:competency_management.field_competency_competency__code
msgid "Competency Code"
msgstr "የብቃት መለያ ኮድ"

#. module: competency_management
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:competency_management.field_competency_competency__pillar
msgid "Pillar"
msgstr "የብቃት ዘርፍ"

#. module: competency_management
#: code:addons/competency_management/models/competency_assessment.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "You cannot approve your own assessment/IDP. This action must be performed by a different authorized user (FR-COM-055)."
msgstr "የራስዎን ምዘና ወይም IDP ማጽደቅ አይችሉም። ይህ ተግባር በሌላ በተፈቀደለት ተጠቃሚ መከናወን አለበት (FR-COM-055)።"

#. module: competency_management
#: code:addons/competency_management/models/competency_role_mapping.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "A mapping for this Job Position at this version already exists. Edit the existing record or create a new version instead."
msgstr "ለዚህ የሥራ መደብ በዚህ ስሪት የተዘጋጀ ካርታ ቀደም ብሎ ይገኛል። እባክዎን ያለውን ያሻሽሉ ወይም አዲስ ስሪት ይፍጠሩ።"

#. module: competency_management
#: code:addons/competency_management/models/competency_competency.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "Behavioral Indicators are required for each proficiency level (FR-COM-003, FR-COM-004)."
msgstr "ለእያንዳንዱ የብቃት ደረጃ የባህሪ ማሳያዎች መሞላት አለባቸው (FR-COM-003, FR-COM-004)።"
